        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>3 · One day</div><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; table-layout:fixed; word-break:break-word; font-size:.8em; margin:.4em 0 .6em;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>Time (IST)</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>Scene</th><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>What happens</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>17:30</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Forecast run</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>noon (UTC) analyses arrive, both models run (about 10 min)</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>18:00</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Evening alert</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>one line per site, operator briefing</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>22:00–08:00</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Stagnation</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>mixing layer falls, pollution pools → reminder for sensitive groups</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>05:30</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Peak</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>worst hour, traffic sites highest</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>06:00</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Morning update</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>re-run on new data, sent before school and commute</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>14:30</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Afternoon breather</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>mixing layer rises, a window to ventilate</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Afterwards</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Verification</td><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>compare with official monitors, correct per site</td></tr></tbody></table><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b;'>Chart: AQI and mixing height at Anand Vihar; blue bands are stagnant hours (wind below 10 km/h, mixing height below 500 m).</div></div>",
