    "60dad025-54d0-59b8-9bec-2821b156b851": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "5. 5 Nov 18:30 IST, the evening alert",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.46,
        "extent": [
          8506701.53,
          3274212.69,
          8751604.41,
          3382011.46
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>4 · Evening · Pollutants: synthetic example</div><ul style='margin:0 0 .5em 1.1em; padding:0;'><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>The first forecast hour. All of Delhi is already \"Very Poor\" or worse; traffic sites (Anand Vihar, ITO, Gurugram) are highest.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>Per-site AQI and the corresponding GRAP level are computed; a one-liner for citizens and a briefing for operators are drafted.</li></ul><div style='background:#0f172a; color:#f8fafc; padding:.5em .8em; border-radius:14px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.85em; line-height:1.4;'><div style='font-size:.75em; opacity:.7; margin-bottom:.15em;'>📱 Citizens · Hindi (first language)</div>[वायु गुणवत्ता चेतावनी] Anand Vihar: अधिकतम AQI 500 (गंभीर), 07 Nov 05:30 IST के आसपास। मुख्य प्रदूषक PM10, PM2.5 अधिकतम 321 µg/m³। स्वस्थ लोग भी प्रभावित।</div><div style='background:#e2e8f0; color:#1e293b; padding:.5em .8em; border-radius:14px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.85em; line-height:1.4;'><div style='font-size:.75em; opacity:.7; margin-bottom:.15em;'>📱 City headline · for operators</div>Delhi-NCR outlook: median peak AQI 433 (Severe); worst site Anand Vihar at AQI 500 (Severe) around 07 Nov 05:30 IST. Corresponds to GRAP Stage 4.</div><div style='background:#fff4e0; border-left:6px solid #b7791f; padding:.45em .7em; border-radius:8px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.9em; color:#1e293b;'><b style='color:#b7791f;'>Government and city</b> · official issuance and channels (SMS, app, broadcast) belong to CAQM and the Delhi government; the system provides the draft and the evidence.</div></div>",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "paneAlignment": "end",
          "panelWidth": "34%"
        },
