    "1ed30ec5-f0a9-5d18-a8d4-a010ffe9cf7b": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "7. 7 Nov 05:30 IST, the worst-hit site",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 12.1,
        "extent": [
          8579998.73,
          3312159.86,
          8658367.65,
          3345134.73
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>6 · Pre-dawn · Pollutants: synthetic example</div><ul style='margin:0 0 .5em 1.1em; padding:0;'><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>The second pre-dawn. Anand Vihar in east Delhi (a traffic site at a bus terminal and arterial roads) reaches AQI 500; ITO, Noida and Okhla exceed 450.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>The 06:00 morning update sends \"peak 07:00–09:00, wear a mask\" before school and commute.</li></ul><div style='background:#e2e8f0; color:#1e293b; padding:.5em .8em; border-radius:14px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.85em; line-height:1.4;'><div style='font-size:.75em; opacity:.7; margin-bottom:.15em;'>📱 Detail for sensitive groups and operators (excerpt)</div>- AQI now 385, peaking at 500 (Severe) around 07 Nov 05:30 IST. Trend: roughly steady.\n- Main pollutant: PM10. PM2.5 up to 321 ug/m3, PM10 up to 514 ug/m3.\n- Dispersion: Stagnant conditions (wind below 10 km/h, mixing height below 500 m) are expected for 12 h, 2 h of them overnight (minimum mixing height about 67 m). Pollution will tend to pool near the surface from night to morning.</div><div style='background:#fff4e0; border-left:6px solid #b7791f; padding:.45em .7em; border-radius:8px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.9em; color:#1e293b;'><b style='color:#b7791f;'>Government and city</b> · peak time and the GRAP basis are the material for the city's decision; enforcement (vehicle limits, construction halts, school closures) is the authority's call.</div></div>",
          "image": "",
          "imageCaption": "",
          "paneAlignment": "end",
          "panelWidth": "34%"
        },
