        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>7 · Uncertainty · Ensemble: Aurora 1.5 Ensemble</div><ul style='margin:0 0 .5em 1.1em; padding:0;'><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>The same model is run <b>3 times</b> with different seeds; each member's mixing height and wind decide stagnation, and the share of stagnant members is the probability.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>Citizens can be told \"very likely\" instead of \"certainly\", and operators can avoid over-reacting on low-probability nights.</li></ul><table style='border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; table-layout:fixed; word-break:break-word; font-size:.8em; margin:.4em 0 .6em;'><thead><tr><th style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>Site</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>Night 1</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>Day</th><th style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:2px solid rgba(100,116,139,.5); color:#64748b; font-size:.9em;'>Night 2</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Anand Vihar</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>43%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>ITO</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>3%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>21%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>43%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Punjabi Bagh</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>24%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>50%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Rohini</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>28%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>50%</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align:left; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>Jahangirpuri</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>12%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>28%</td><td style='text-align:right; padding:.3em .45em; border-bottom:1px solid rgba(100,116,139,.25); vertical-align:top;'>50%</td></tr></tbody></table><div style='background:#e6f3f7; border-left:6px solid #0b6e8f; padding:.45em .7em; border-radius:8px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.9em; color:#1e293b;'><b style='color:#0b6e8f;'>What this system shows</b> · the ensemble run and the probabilities are automatic; the thresholds that turn them into wording are agreed with health authorities.</div></div>",
          "image": "",
