    "05204f19-ec33-5ea0-b00f-449b7bcb095a": {
      "type": "StorySegmentLayer",
      "name": "12. Done, and still to do",
      "visible": true,
      "parameters": {
        "zoom": 10.46,
        "extent": [
          8506701.53,
          3274212.69,
          8751604.41,
          3382011.46
        ],
        "enableIdentify": true,
        "content": {
          "contentMode": "map",
          "markdown": "<div style='font-size:16px; line-height:1.5; min-height:84vh;'><div style='font-size:.8em; color:#64748b; letter-spacing:.03em; margin:0 0 .5em;'>11 · Next steps</div><ul style='margin:0 0 .5em 1.1em; padding:0;'><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>Five items were run in this example: ensemble uncertainty, the correction procedure, a training-procedure check, the delivery adapter and automation.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>Everything that remains presupposes <b>cooperation with government and city</b>: official observations, further training on regional data, pollutant data.</li><li style='margin:0 0 .35em 0;'>In one line: Aurora computes \"when, where and why\" 12 to 48 hours ahead; turning that into citizens' actions is the job of institutions and channels.</li></ul><div style='background:#f8fafc; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; padding:.45em .7em; border-radius:8px; margin:.5em 0; font-size:.9em; color:#1e293b;'>Slides: <a href='https://notebook.link/github/playground-for-thinker/aurora/tree/storymap/specta/?path=storyboard_en.ipynb'>English</a> · <a href='https://notebook.link/github/playground-for-thinker/aurora/tree/storymap/specta/?path=storyboard_ko.ipynb'>한국어</a> · Korean version of this map story: <a href='https://notebook.link/github/playground-for-thinker/aurora/tree/storymap/specta/?path=delhi_aq_storymap_ko.jGIS'>한국어 스토리 맵</a></div></div>",
